# Rendered cards reading a model dbt tags `dev`. The production run builds
# tag:production and excludes tag:dev from docs, so no dbt test and no Elementary
# monitor covers these — the card can go wrong with nothing upstream noticing.
# Cards staged behind a disabled sector or tab are not listed: that is the correct
# way to hold a feature, and they fail this check when the sector is enabled.
# See docs/lessons/upstream-rename-breaks-a-card.md

api_execution_yields_lending_top_lenders_latest -> dbt.api_execution_lending_top_lenders_latest
